sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant ML as Magic Link Form
  participant R as POST /api/auth/magic-link
  participant SB as Supabase Auth
  participant E as Email Inbox
  participant CB as /auth/callback
  participant AS as auth.service.ts
  participant PR as profile.repo.ts
  participant DB as profiles table
  participant D as Dashboard

  Note over U,D: Magic link PKCE flow

  U->>ML: enters email
  ML->>R: POST { email }
  R->>SB: signInWithOtp\n{ email,\n  emailRedirectTo:\n  APP_URL/auth/callback }
  SB-->>R: ok
  R-->>ML: 200
  ML-->>U: Check your email
  SB->>E: magic link email
  U->>E: clicks link
  E->>CB: /auth/callback?code=...
  CB->>SB: exchangeCodeForSession(code)
  SB-->>CB: user + session cookies set
  CB->>AS: ensureOAuthProfile(user)
  AS->>PR: ensureProfile({ id, name, role })
  PR->>DB: SELECT + INSERT if missing
  AS-->>CB: void
  CB->>D: redirect /dashboard
